    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41962" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτά-κλῑνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with seven couches</i> or
				<i>beds,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phryn.
				</span></i>
			 Com.<i><span class="en">
				66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				2.18
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιτών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Callix.
				</span></i>
			 I; and without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος,</span>
			Tim.Com.I ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θὲς ἑπτάκλινον</span> place
				<i>seven seats,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				121
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δέρμα κατέχει εἰς ἑ.
				ἀποταθέν</span> provides sitting-room for <i>seven,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				630a22
			</span></i> : hence, as a measure of area, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				80.48
			</span></i>.</div>
